    esco:nodeLiteral "Take an active role in promoting the principles of democracy, social justice and the rule of law. Confront discrimination based on ethnic, cultural or sexual identity or orientation as well as social, educational, or economic background, by assessing and voicing the implications for different groups of any planned action, including legislation, policies or programmes." .

