    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Use a problem-solving approach to develop and measure recommendations for improving the quality of professional practice in increasingly unpredictable contexts, contributing to change and development within the profession or service at a local, regional or national level." .

