    esco:nodeLiteral "Evaluate the activities carried out in the execution of a project (from initiating to closing) in order to ensure the compliance with a given methodology which aims to ensure that projects are run effectively within the defined constraints. It can be supported by the usage of a standard quality assurance checklists customized for the use of the specific organization." .

