    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Enterprise architects balance technological opportunities with business requirements. They also maintain a holistic view of the organisation's strategy, processes, information and ICT assets and link the business mission, strategy and processes to the ICT strategy." .

