    esco:nodeLiteral "IoT developers analyse and gather data for interpreting the pattern and predicting the result. They use artificial intelligence for managing the tasks and autonomous decisions, employing machine learning algorithms to create smarter devices through data sensors. IoT developers create software for connecting objects to systems and devices, or for programming these objects to make them function on their own." .

<http://data.europa.eu/esco/node-literal/2c6b15d3-56ad-4284-9fdd-688f91717495> a esco:NodeLiteral ;
