    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral """Wholesale and retail sales is the study of buying and selling goods and services, including stock management, pricing practices, loss prevention, sales systems and procedures. It includes the study of the workings and current trends of the wholesale and retail industries. Selling of buildings and properties is also included.
Programmes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:
Auctioneering
Consumer services
Demonstration techniques
Purchasing
Real-estate business
Retailing
Stock-keeping
Ware-housing
Wholesaling === Inclusions
Study of buying and selling buildings and properties is included here.""" .

