    esco:nodeLiteral """Methods and procedures typical for defence applications such as the NATO Standardization Agreements or STANAGs
Standard definitions of the processes, procedures, terms, and conditions for common military or technical procedures or equipment. Guidelines for capability planners, programme managers and test managers to prescribe the necessary technical standards and profiles to achieve interoperability of Communications and Information Systems.""" .

