    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Cloud DevOps engineers implement and manage continuous software delivery systems and methodologies. This includes managing and configuring code repositories, build services, automated testing, and deployment mechanisms. For cloud-based workloads, a Cloud DevOps Engineer define and deploy infrastructure as code, automating test and development environments. They can define and configure automated disaster recovery solutions that meet business objectives." .

<http://data.europa.eu/esco/node-literal/37d866d8-da02-4f57-acb2-7629fd230645> a esco:NodeLiteral ;
    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "The cooperation between people characterised by a unified commitment to achieving a given goal, participating equally, maintaining open communication, facilitating effective usage of ideas etc." .

