    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Draft technical specifications that enable potential bidders to submit realistic offers that directly address the underlying need of the organisation. This includes setting objectives and minimum requirements for the subject matter, and define the exclusion, selection and award criteria which will be used to identify the Most Economically Advantageous Tender (MEAT), in line with the organisation policy and EU and national regulations." .

