    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Utilise a specialised system to track registration, processing and resolution of issues in an organisation by assigning each of these issues a ticket, registering inputs from involved persons, tracking changes and displaying the status of the ticket, until it is completed." .

