    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Communicate about scientific findings to a non-scientific audience, including the general public. Tailor the communication of scientific concepts, debates, findings to the audience, using a variety of methods for different target groups, including visual presentations." .

