    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Be aware of and make use of constitutional and legal rights, including the duty to obey the law, pay taxes, and render assistance as well as the right to vote, to be elected, or to have a defence lawyer present in trial." .

