    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Plan, coordinate and supervise engineering activities together with engineers and engineering technicians. Ensure clear and effective channels of communication across all departments. Make sure the team is aware of the standards and objectives of the research and development." .

