    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral """Statistics is the study of collecting, describing, arranging and analysing numerical data. The study of probability theory and actuarial science is included.
Programmes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:
Actuarial science
Probability theory
Statistics, applied
Survey design
Survey sampling === Inclusions
Study of mathematical (theoretical) statistics is included here. === Exclusions
Demography/population studies is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0314 'Sociology and cultural studies'.""" .

