    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Develop and implement strategies which ensure that swift and efficient actions can be taken in the event of a disruption in the generation, transmission, or distribution of electrical energy, such as a power outage or sudden increase of demand." .

<http://data.europa.eu/esco/node-literal/b3be8371-455b-4c5f-99f1-ef7fb9360b2a> a esco:NodeLiteral ;
    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Maintain an overview of all the incoming tasks in order to prioritise the tasks, plan their execution, and integrate new tasks as they present themselves." .

