    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Model designed to generate a virtual representation of an object or system updated from real-time data. The virtual representation process is through the combination of data and technology simulation, using sensors to produce data of the physical object, such as temperature or energy to build its digital twin. Machine learning, simulation and reasoning are involved in this process." .

