    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Determine cross-account authentication and access strategy for complex organizations (for example, an organization with varying compliance requirements, multiple business units, and varying scalability requirements). Design networks and multi-account cloud environments for complex organizations." .

