    esco:nodeLiteral "Perform simulated social engineering attacks to identify vulnerabilities in an organization's security posture. Social engineering tests may involve phishing emails, pretexting, or other forms of manipulation used by attackers to obtain sensitive information or unauthorized access to systems." .

