    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "Perform routine maintenance tasks on audiovisual equipment as well as minor repairs, such as replacing parts and calibrating the instruments, on equipment used in processing sound and images." .

<http://data.europa.eu/esco/node-literal/fdacdf9a-c2dc-4f68-817f-c669e9ba56d6> a esco:NodeLiteral ;
    esco:language "en"^^xsd:language ;
    esco:nodeLiteral "The system software BlackBerry consists of features, restrictions, architectures and other characteristics of operating systems designed to run on mobile devices." .

